<html ><head ><meta charset="UTF-8"  /><meta name="author" content="Martin Walther - @tinuwalther"  /><meta name="keywords" content="Pode, PSHTML, PowerShell, Mermaid Diagram"  /><meta name="description" content="Builds beatuifull HTML-Files with PSHTML from native PowerShell-Scripts"  /><link href="\assets\BootStrap\bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet"  /><link href="\assets\style\style.css" rel="stylesheet"  /><script src="\assets\BootStrap\bootstrap.bundle.min.js"  ></script><script src="\assets\Chartjs\Chart.bundle.min.js"  ></script><title >#PSXi Update Assets</title><link href="/assets/img/favicon.ico" rel="icon" type="image/x-icon"  /></head><Body ><header ><div Class="jumbotron text-center" Id="j1" Style="padding:15; background-color:#012456"  ><p ><h1 >#PSXi Update Assets</h1></p><p >I ♥ PS Pode > This is an example for using pode and PSHTML, requested by API. The page is 
$(if(Test-Path 'D:\github.com\PodePSHTML\views\Update-Assets.pode'){
    $($regex = '[0-9]{4}\-[0-9]{2}\-[0-9]{2}\s[0-9]{2}\:[0-9]{2}\:[0-9]{2}')
    $($index = Get-Content 'D:\github.com\PodePSHTML\views\Update-Assets.pode')
    $($created = Get-Date ([regex]::Match($index, $regex).Value))
    $($diffTime = New-TimeSpan -Start $created -End (Get-Date))
    $(if($diffTime.TotalMinutes -gt 60 -and $diffTime.TotalMinutes -lt 1440){
        # $badge = 'badge badge-warning' # Bootstrap v4.6.x
        $badge = 'badge text-bg-warning' # Bootstrap v5.3.x
    }elseif($diffTime.TotalMinutes -gt 1440){
        # $badge = 'badge badge-danger' # Bootstrap v4.6.x
        $badge = 'badge text-bg-danger' # Bootstrap v5.3.x
    }else{
        # $badge = 'badge badge-success' # Bootstrap v4.6.x 
        $badge = 'badge text-bg-success' # Bootstrap v5.3.x
    })
    $(span -class $badge {'{0} Days {1} Hours {2} Minutes' -f $diffTime.Days, $diffTime.Hours, $diffTime.Minutes})
})
 old.</p></div></header><Section Id="section"  ><nav Class="navbar navbar-expand-sm bg-dark navbar-dark sticky-top"  ><div Class="container-fluid"  ><a Target="_self" Class="navbar-brand" href="/"  >»HOME</a><button Class="navbar-toggler" data-bs-target="#collapsibleNavbar" data-bs-toggle="collapse" type="button"  ><span Class="navbar-toggler-icon"  ></span></button><div Class="collapse navbar-collapse" Id="collapsibleNavbar"  ><ul Class="navbar-nav"  ><li Class="nav-item"  ><a Target="_self" Class="nav-link" href="#Bootstrap"  >Bootstrap</a></li><li Class="nav-item dropdown"  ><button Class="nav-link dropdown-toggle btn btn-sm-outline" data-bs-toggle="dropdown" type="button"  >Packages</button><ul Class="dropdown-menu bg-dark navbar-dark"  ><li Class="nav-item"  ><a Target="_self" Class="nav-link" href="#Packages"  >Packages</a></li><li Class="dropdown-item bg-dark navbar-dark"  ><a Target="_self" Class="nav-link" href="#UpdJQuery"  >Update Jquery</a></li><li Class="dropdown-item bg-dark navbar-dark"  ><a Target="_self" Class="nav-link" href="#UpdateChart"  >Update Chart</a></li><li Class="dropdown-item bg-dark navbar-dark"  ><a Target="_self" Class="nav-link" href="#UpdateMermaid"  >Update Mermaid</a></li></ul><li Class="nav-item"  ><a Target="_self" Class="nav-link" href="/help"  >Help</a></li></li></ul></div></div></nav><div Class="Container" Id="Content"  ><article Id="Bootstrap"  ><h1 Style="color:#212529"  >Bootstrap</h1><p Style="color:#50C878"  ><b >Current JavaScript version: 5.3.3</b><b >, current CSS version: 5.3.3</b></p><h2 Id="UpdateBootstrap" Style="color:#212529"  >How to update Bootstrap</h2><p Style="color:#000"  >Open <a Target="_blank" href="https://getbootstrap.com/"  >Bootstrap</a> and scroll down to <b >Include via CDN.</b></p><p Style="color:#000"  >Browse to the URL in link href of the bootstrap.min.css, mark the whole content, and copy & paste the content in to your bootstrap.min.css-file.</p><pre Style="color:#000"  >&#36;response = Invoke-WebRequest -Uri 'https://getbootstrap.com/'</pre><pre Style="color:#000"  >&#36;regex = 'https\:\/\/cdn\.jsdelivr\.net\/npm\/bootstrap\@[0-9]\.[0-9]\.[0-9]\/dist\/css\/bootstrap\.min\.css'</pre><pre Style="color:#000"  >&#36;uri = if(&#36;response.Content -match &#36;regex){&#36;Matches[0]}</pre><pre Style="color:#000"  >Invoke-WebRequest -Uri &#36;uri -OutFile &#36;BootstrapCssPath -PassThru</pre><p Style="color:#000"  >Browse to the URL in script src of the bootstrap.bundle.min.js, mark the whole content, and copy & paste the content in to your bootstrap.bundle.min.js-file.</p><pre Style="color:#000"  >&#36;response = Invoke-WebRequest -Uri 'https://getbootstrap.com/'</pre><pre Style="color:#000"  >&#36;regex = 'https\:\/\/cdn\.jsdelivr\.net\/npm\/bootstrap\@[0-9]\.[0-9]\.[0-9]\/dist\/js\/bootstrap\.bundle\.min\.js'</pre><pre Style="color:#000"  >&#36;uri = if(&#36;response.Content -match &#36;regex){&#36;Matches[0]}</pre><pre Style="color:#000"  >Invoke-WebRequest -Uri &#36;uri -OutFile &#36;BootstrapJsPath -PassThru</pre></article></div><hr /><div Class="Container" Id="Content"  ><article Id="Packages"  ><h1 Style="color:#212529"  >NPM Packages</h1><p Style="color:#50C878"  ><b >Current Jquery version: 3.5.1</b><b >, current Chart version: 2.9.3</b></p></article><article Id="CDNPKG"  ><h2 Style="color:#212529"  >CDNPKG</h2><p Style="color:#000"  >CDNPKG is like a search engine but only for web assets (js, css, fonts etc.).</p><p Style="color:#000"  >The primary goal is to help developers to find their web assets more easily for production or development/test.</p><p Style="color:#000"  ><a Target="_blank" href="https://www.cdnpkg.com/Chart.js/file/Chart.bundle.min.js/"  >chart.bundle.min.js</a> | <a Target="_blank" href="https://www.cdnpkg.com/jquery/file/jquery.min.js/"  >jquery.min.js</a> | <a Target="_blank" href="https://www.cdnpkg.com/mermaid?id=87189"  >mermaid</a></p></article><article Id="UNPKG"  ><h2 Style="color:#212529"  >UNPKG</h2><p Style="color:#000"  >UNPKG is a fast, global content delivery network for everything on npm.</p><p Style="color:#000"  ><a Target="_blank" href="https://unpkg.com/browse/jquery.min.js/"  >jquery.min.js</a> | <a Target="_blank" href="https://unpkg.com/mermaid/"  >mermaid</a></p></article><article ><h2 Id="UpdJQuery" Style="color:#212529"  >How to update JQuery</h2><p Style="color:#000"  >Open <a Target="_blank" href="https://www.cdnpkg.com/jquery/file/jquery.min.js/"  >jquery.min.js</a>, find the latest version, mark the whole content, and copy & paste the content in to your jquery.min.js-file</p><h2 Id="UpdateChart" Style="color:#212529"  >How to update Chart Bundle</h2><p Style="color:#000"  >Open <a Target="_blank" href="https://www.cdnpkg.com/Chart.js/file/Chart.bundle.min.js/"  >chart.bundle.min.js</a>, find the latest version, mark the whole content, and copy & paste the content in to your Chart.bundle.min.js-file</p><h2 Id="UpdateMermaid" Style="color:#212529"  >How to update Mermaid</h2><p Style="color:#000"  >Open <a Target="_blank" href="https://www.cdnpkg.com/mermaid?id=87189"  >mermaid.min.js</a>, find the latest version, mark the whole content, and copy & paste the content in to your mermaid.min.js-file</p></article></div></Section><pre Style="color:#000"  >Re-builds the page: I ♥ PS > Invoke-WebRequest -Uri http://localhost:8080/api/asset -Method Post</pre></Body><div Class="container-fluid" Style="background-color:#343a40"  ><footer ><div Class="container-fluid"  ><div Class="row align-items-center"  ><div Class="col-md"  ><p ><a Target="_self" Class="btn-sm btn btn-outline-success" href="#"  >I ♥ PS ></a></p></div><div Class="col-md"  ><p >Based on <a Target="_blank" href="https://www.powershellgallery.com/packages/Pode"  >pode</a> and <a Target="_blank" href="https://www.powershellgallery.com/packages/PSHTML"  >PSHTML</a></p></div><div Class="col-md" Style="color:#000"  ><p >Created at 2024-08-18 12:13:53</p></div></div></div></footer></div></html>
